I am in this big market.
I do not know the way.
I see a woman.
She has shopping bags in her hands.
I walk towards her.
"Excuse me," I say.
"Which is the way to the walkway?" I ask.
That woman smiles.
"You are in the market now," she says.
"First, walk out from here."
"Go back to the main road."
"From there, go straight."
"Walk straight until the end of the road."
"From there, turn right."
"That road goes straight to the walkway," she says.
I understand the way.
"Thank you very much," I say.
She nods happily.
I walk back to the main road.
